    "The Player closes and opens again in the new language. Anything playing stops." : {
      "comment" : "Under the question before the Player restarts in another language",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يُغلَق المشغل ثم يُفتح من جديد باللغة الجديدة، ويتوقف ما يُعرض الآن."
